data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "synth-1", "text": "Drafted 'polarization_splitting_optical_tweezers' on a 380x450 mm plate: 5x lens, 3x mirror, 2x pbs, 1x half wave plate, 1x dichroic, 1x vapor cell, 1x beam dump, 1x photodiode. Mach-Zehnder polarization-splitting optical tweezers (Figure 5, arXiv:2004.05246). A trapping laser is split by a half-wave plate and PBS1 into two orthogonally polarized arms steered by galvo mirrors GM1 and GM2, recombin"}

